  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83d4f9973d414da0eef011de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态也还不错，只要努力了的话就…啊。开，开玩笑！玩笑玩笑～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3928ef9d5130dda6c8303044acf85435c492a24d2d52404c11c7bb36084ac75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2c6e0b776b494724c5f511e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，能做的事都做了。\n之后就看跑的怎样了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbc016307b2039e5e1f64676621a7c3c0cd941390ae3a58d4f4be3ffa8bb9f86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28a3724f956b2a00ab96f32b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得冷静地跑，\n跟着人流就行了。\n啊…差不多吧，马马虎虎！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf6faddb74510098b3a6d93781637e74bffb6db92acd2248f727dc85afcba7ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4776a947b3e086bddd3b308",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我来说，做得很好了。对我来说呢！ 这个，真的很重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c2e264ade3d29dea005dd2915295fbb0ac47ea0e0eb984d3771f0ec350859a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:301551c4c38e34afc1e6a50c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像能和平时一样奔跑呢…\n这是好事还是坏事呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "27f0fc45a8bded11587d340f914c4906392dd0dd53530787e376e3e206ecacca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a3f1575a02b6444d4f46282",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是和平时一样的状态，\n所以…也和平时一样\n期待着就行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a9e721dfc51fd8f50f46c44dea80bddf51234b7f3b3a28ccf4d398ad73b75f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:435ab5e235905716883c0b5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态不好也不坏。\n能好好比赛就好了啊ー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e36e71e585f53bf6cfe8e7a63dbd4311c78c68b58c70df45acb54fca971d6f34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77fca24c547cd85ba355e293",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经到正式演出了吗。\n嗯…既然到了这个时候\n就只有平心静气了吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7c7d03e742b6d74feb85e4ba9e0ccf2885e638498989f9958e81b6d822b5509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ff112febb38476e74096964",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊ー…加油跑的话\n奇迹什么的会发生吧～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2404905e5b0d0837ce9d019aedca680fb3273bd0c21c3f15fdb11b7a9207a50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51da1ff6932681eab5fb4999",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管怎么抱怨，\n现状都不会改变的。\n调整好心态，继续跑吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a96eb833a0b9903de2d331eb305df38674fa09fb06a01984e04043406981a47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:098bce81a9632ab35a66e2d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀ー。说实话我很不安…\n但能做的事我一定会做好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff079704cb56cc3c3bad13949db95318f47bad26bb5df8141a12321e458bbe92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7df423d9c715c82722f50afa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…都到这里了\n如果还对自己没有信心的话，\n也说不过吧？大概。",
      "source_fingerprint": "238e24e45679ca15e74d61977cb39984682aaf28ca97e4db13bc460d656e6cdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a961467bcef0b3107617a56d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力到这种地步了，\n怎么也要留下点痕迹啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c610e17674dc005bfc349c0f631515d7d6b65b4dac1c9bda6062cfb48fd709d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:949eae22e9de52ebd9e48b72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明白了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a2d68c4ff9cf3599c629adf9fd7b4ee5f4b10e6408f421a524401a5087b17b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bb2623a60c263d0c26ff4ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3837c0fb988527b79ed372344d6392747daee0d5861d57996ea30f7e1ba5c1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:293a66065cfa01648900d1a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿ー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab4ee3880fd7ffb923130db5b8d60bf5ad947b02f33226199f1b15a4d9fa9e37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ee6bcc720cc9053b688acf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学习时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "454a4374f92debea49725f95a733f5dc9b2805be183ef8ad2ce4ce4db0a4ef80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fdace8ca0f033350022d0d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6d09d3bf68ecfe25b03c1bbfa1cc896088838b9b654cf7cddb2ba7226922267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44c30f95e0387316e459449d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d17809827b0889e5a0b80dbad0f7eef8501c7ca15d5376b38cd26eaa7264a2e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c93788797218b44373ec0d04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯。出发吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "65e3f8a518570a7a076b68813c9b4af92070553bbf2927a436812d5769b4bc45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd1810ed9ec0d2072c272bb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大海？这不是很好吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8bd7d8689230d1d989d818d5b5fa06a5dc59f9e51b1009f5c3d96aca54b8337",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45d07aa112b5ae4f89101de2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢啦，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd9b94ece2cc45cf620f3785c0a51b07993020e4c680539cc0ea3ab4d47210f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bcd7de55ed02fc0fd29273a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，很开心哦。谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0383d0175cf0d26063b0f5ea650052731928a1c682ceab3f76ff181cc895ce54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adbcacfb3396d2dea9532a37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，就这么做吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f58d6c45b724bc1b24847fe47b6732aa34024c87086ac2c6a80062d997d319e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32c0a6c172a3c8d00a5e7ce8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这么做吧ー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a30040f9c2e7ee208d423ba5aaf6ed44a624cfc4e1311360628b766e148a0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e15ddc9f2b9a25af3b9f4007",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "慢慢地，出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fb8a181bf936411134ba83d13b8d5ddca0ec3defecaa13ce6866b8983df2c2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aa93dcb879a0377b61e0c62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，很开心哦。谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0383d0175cf0d26063b0f5ea650052731928a1c682ceab3f76ff181cc895ce54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc8f4cc0ca9a2dabe53d7f89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我来说，做得很好了。\r\n对我来说呢！ 这个，真的很重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19adacb218cf35af6607c0fd15d93018841e8ddfa2939dfd1143a89737417550",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15e9c0207167140a9dec7302",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态也还不错，只要努力了的话就…\r\n啊。开，开玩笑！玩笑玩笑～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cf8482556e492fd1a8f2a1a47af59ee0e42ece1f06257a8b6e05b8ac08c1a0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
