      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdd8b495d0ac3392c616f6ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，很开心哦。谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0383d0175cf0d26063b0f5ea650052731928a1c682ceab3f76ff181cc895ce54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c7ab882f566443097891f24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張りますか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e94c4aa45b953e789c30ce49bfc885ddb721af36adaff4305dcbd4c37283ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54c83bad2800fe00d6f13527",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这不是…第二名吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f13213557681ef39e93ce990302b139ed66c5b8c91890ad41b739b6fba1f398c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9912cb911099af3c90507c30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "熟悉的第三名！开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eb56e3eba3ecf1765ee5244c5341fad06be52d94aafd1a59d7252228838a4a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:614ce58cf74018d262573cae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正如看见的一样…吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0bfce5eebb895a16be6a04ed5e290558abf314f52bfbb0f526377783b979a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efc2014ef44a6e6ae06791f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪闪发光的，是梦中的梦吗…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cf847c0b2a0c5d64f0c6d28f50cc6a4d8d0b28ea5ff2c370cd243ac6cc7878f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de1131e60ee471f9e98b7da5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是第一，对…吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7932ad05f152c9837bc096df11a7561c3478c93aa9cc73fe356d1c870f9b2ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862d1c672e6a4b22f4f39637",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛…谢谢你给我加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38d594bd7983607551a8176d0e6ba6589908bf9100cc92c9f8c0acf04eca0f8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb521a06e43ee18f3c0e112",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "GOー！GOー！内恰！\r\n…开玩笑的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ecc0d1e1e4d7d0f33749caddd18965bfc3752921a4c3bbecde3c93e09b4b4c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c63029975507d67434dfee1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛…谢谢你给我加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38d594bd7983607551a8176d0e6ba6589908bf9100cc92c9f8c0acf04eca0f8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:384d4712a8768ad87af9f5f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この晴れ着が、あと1歩をくれたかな…ふふっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5c73cf8b95da07090b955b37922f2c47f4011c1e43d8e484702f524c1e4a6ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:492bb7ab54454e801fdb131a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まあ…応援、ありがとね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "377c2fd62fd7f427da455d6d678e0ef3d05f2b8cb6ef28c55b2dcf20fc90d88b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee545699f8b7baefc30bdb6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…在那里看好吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e5d1b36787b0e5c6405849b6e239bce828660ed86a4bbf99ead45532f9439bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1756c419e4e0eeba2c490f1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "梦想…光看是不行的，对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d525cb0ebf534b30fd0d3294b72059ea267809cbca99aeecaa56f7902cfd8751",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9acf75c8c6526bce340381c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "团长真有干劲啊～。\r\n虽然我们应该在一旁…\r\n好好地加油才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b07b7795fba159b64058c85c7445d732ef46e01bd775357c0c08855ad06ca23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb8dc4016d34a0ed06551645",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想参加直舞的人～\r\n请面向我这边喊出「我～」哦～\r\n预备～",
      "source_fingerprint": "86c7d2974c8379e8cdc2b3f66c43cef3523c620435ad06fdf03d44866c9df632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a82c5f3efedf804cc7ff8a0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我大概明白…\r\n但光环真的\r\n很难让人移开视线呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bd8ed517810a45562da67b9d22ffcc37b86c6b118050311c158a1417879a18f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14d4d0dae7f5aa280b9f4f80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるって決めたからには、努力は\r\nしておかんとね…にしても、\r\n商店街のみんなノリ良すぎでしょ…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7db84e82c8163541341cd3fd663c7ed1ec05d26f2187271ade538542c7f392f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c694c27cf2b018f0baabf1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "梦想…光看是不行的，对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d525cb0ebf534b30fd0d3294b72059ea267809cbca99aeecaa56f7902cfd8751",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9daeb15e0ee320a11d7abbd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油～…哦ー！\r\n…嗯、嗯。果然还是不习惯。\r\n但这助威应该能起点作用吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "abbd7c93d828353c01d1e27be1fc845642be4fb6a6bf5922bf10a0ace9531ea0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fbd1d3450ee2b4dc238f086",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了，好好努力了呢～。\r\n诶，还想要我加油？\r\n…下次再说吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fcc8ab4eddfec42e82fcacad4a617579332d814a4914b9458b698b04cfa0920",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877d838147c61a131e123deb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得意，过头了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "50e7d4dc3aa7a4ebbce79572b3613f9dbc26b97706a67859eab6c414b161250f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f4d19233782d0e7d6f13ba6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Go for it！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fe3ed9755ee87d7f19cdc4f61609eb54a3998f9d10b993d121dcaec2ccf5e7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55468a9c5de1438ffb80158a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞要上咯！U！M！A！赛马娘！呜～…\r\nRUN！and！WIN！…咳哈",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f3714b82d9f75d223f8c40378d17c41c9a05a06a0090ec0ed393b17501493ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58c477e5feb6aa5ac0df9289",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～我真～的是累坏了……\r\n不过感觉……还不错啦。\r\n……明天也简单努力一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4755730d9e736047a335f21f5145c266c9b4e195dbee2919260ec54499bab3f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "400047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c202e7a71ff14844e536011",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈……灯光下实在太热了。\r\n下次干脆把冷气调更……\r\n准备一件凉快点的礼服好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "853bf0b77382437cc10430fcebd471f785b110d514bc944326f11315caeb6219",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "400050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ef54ac0fd64a7c2c8949c69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晴れ舞台、だからねっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea2e568d9ddc78f8eebcc5352aae31e7799b1c50b7e31119ae524bc4c81cff2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efa35c2edb44a6054ca8fd60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さてさて、初市へようこそ～！\r\n…もぐもぐ…んっ？\r\n…アタシなんか見てて、楽しいです？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8befcc7ec8f133fc732f0b7f2c445378643bcfe915fdb14178c87c89a6e36abe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85bb47dc7c7b9f091b0300a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尝试一下吗ー",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6827ca841ca5e96db259e87efc406e0e05ec06e8303f2cbfcf10740c014e5ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cdbe208d47975a10e71e2b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a45daa99d47f792f2e008a4d0f0b1b9ac1f29d1a3b8800e80d5d08a8e678d39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
