      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:776962c8d9e07fcd155a95e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "相应的，就这么做吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "277c620a6f441dd2bb16e2c56368969bc6fea6acf361deb010416ff5de462fd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad2f25073270071941417047",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在也觉得很不可思议呢。你为什么\n会跟经常比赛，但却都是配角的我…\n打招呼呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7f3d0effc1134ce345d8f33aeebf8efe97532d02525cd6de8e1b6fec3c0f342",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ec5415d4f11d3412c29af6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈…至少要把褶边弄好吧～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "999f29447d5df94f8afb09c85695a48ee5252688890c657917e05183c6bc0a8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62819cceb8ef1da1673574a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好羞…这样的，不合适啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d83e0c7ff6b3117852eb952805b28b0f76fa9d92d30cc10a81ff5a61ebd0e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e7dbefa278c6d0f34dfe23b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊…不行不行。要打起精神才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55061b7ec3a3d9cae0a94cfb632cd456de52c6932d73cb3cf2f1756378fe1caf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6de7b22df8d78f5fdb2b568a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这双长靴…选的还挺大胆的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d5cd5fcf5a03f650ae04cb4177cdb62835ed69896d884ed5156554d0cff5572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:582af1a13f780053c492142d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜哇～…太可爱了！痒痒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c879b9361b7ab441a2e4b6592f387aa09e09fbb7fdd7e6ff7868cc4996b89487",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fbcb83360b3c86731fecd58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎，怎样？不会看不下去…就行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "499e30a2bc7a591f20aa65b11529d1ee5918b20bd970c82d14a116247388dc92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40f3b2e9f310dfe2b00ff782",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管怎么说，周围的人都在给我加油。\r\n我也干脆再加把劲吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9942dbd3940cefa9e7873058278f026e160bfb086bc145ff26a25d497f2b96b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0a3fcbb4c01947a64fda01a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "GOーGOー！训练员！\r\n…还是把刚才的忘掉吧，忘掉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d1fbeadc357ce8564079a1dbd1de0da9ed5e1efce41902aba347b37dacd0902",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fd6936020b84dfb75d900a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪闪发光着呢ー……",
      "source_fingerprint": "21b552ffcf2bdea4f63503e30a4304029d6ae64e978dde1f93fe130b9a3bb8f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
